                    {
                        at 2026-06-28T14:54:39.671317Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @note
                        text "Approach: user chose \"expand tests, then full convert\". Step 1 (test net) DONE. Added tests/test_pmatch.rs: 8 tests covering union/concat/optional/predefined-acceptors(*,+)/definition-reference(DAG)/deep-multilevel-DAG(test.pmatch french streets)/EndTag-runtime-match/Numeral-runtime-match. Baselined green on the raw-pointer code. Note: compile() only returns TOP in the result map (intermediate defs referenced internally), so tests assert on TOP only.\n\nSurvey findings (Explore agent) driving the conversion:\n- AST is a DAG not a tree: symbol_from_global_context returns the SAME *mut dyn PmatchObject stored in DEFINITIONS, also referenced from expression trees + CALL_STACK. -> safe repr = Rc<RefCell<dyn PmatchObject>> (NOT Box). Rc<RefCell<dyn T>> IS constructible via unsize coercion through RefCell/UnsafeCell.\n- Current code LEAKS (157 into_raw vs 82 from_raw; init_globals clears maps without freeing) -> no free discipline to preserve; Rc is strictly better.\n- 49 static mut: scalar flags (verbose/flatten/format/len/timer/counters), C-string buffers (data/startptr *mut c_char via libc::strdup, never freed), 3 AST-pointer collections (DEFINITIONS/DEF_INSED_EXPRESSIONS/CALL_STACK), ~12 plain collections, utils:*mut PmatchUtilityTransducers. Accessor pattern: `fn definitions() -> &'static mut BTreeMap<..>` via addr_of_mut!. Rc is !Send so globals MUST become thread_local! (not Mutex) -> &'static mut accessors must move to closure-based with_borrow_mut at ~50+ sites.\n- Single-threaded. RefCell re-entrancy hazard: a self-referential (recursive) pmatch definition would panic (double borrow) where raw ptr just recursed -- not covered by tests; acceptable, note it.\n- compile() -> HashMap<String, *mut HfstTransducer> (result transducers, caller-owned). PmatchTransducerContainer wraps *mut HfstTransducer as a PmatchObject. evaluate(&mut self) -> *mut HfstTransducer is the hot trait method (22 impls).\n\nNext: full thread_local + Rc<RefCell> conversion (subagent-driven, gated by build + 8 test_pmatch + 2 smokes + 121 suite)."
                    }

